UNISEP minimal EMG-BIDS example
================================

Synthetic data. One subject, one 10-s recording from a 2 x 4 HD-sEMG grid on the
right vastus lateralis (8 monopolar channels, 1000 Hz, EDF+).

Electrode positions are given in the device-internal child coordinate system
'gridVL' (mm). It is anchored to the UNISEP right-thigh coordinate system 'thigh'
(percent) through ParentCoordinateSystem, AnchorElectrode and AnchorCoordinates.
MeasurementMethod and PrecisionLevel in the gridVL coordinate-system file are
UNISEP extension keys, not BIDS keys.

Generated by scripts/make_bids_minimal.py; see https://unisep-framework.github.io
